### Third-Party Assets & Typography Disclaimer

1. **Local Typefaces (`frontend/public/fonts/`)**:
   Certain font files bundled for educational, demonstration, and personal prototyping purposes (e.g., SVN-Optima, iCiel Cubano, Gilroy) are the intellectual property of their respective creators and type foundries. They are included strictly for non-commercial interface preview demonstration. For commercial deployment, users must acquire appropriate licenses from the respective type foundries or rely on open-source alternatives (Google Fonts: Outfit, Montserrat, Be Vietnam Pro).

2. **Sample Profile Imagery**:
   Profile avatars and portfolio photography utilized in sample demonstration profiles are sourced from Unsplash under the Unsplash License (free for commercial and non-commercial use, attribution encouraged).
